$ pda help del-db
$ pda del-db --help
Delete a database.

Usage:
  pda del-db DB [flags]

Aliases:
  del-db, delete-db, rm-db, remove-db

Flags:
  -f, --force   Force delete without confirmation
  -h, --help    help for del-db
